        <p>Tile kcal ll,arch is following the inslructions issur d by tie Geoeral Executive and have dr -:ided to canvass .the whole of the Iridi vote in 'Warrington and have already commenced operations. lheirish vr•te is of g.ave consequence in this cr.nslituency and no one recognizes this more tlen tl.e Executive. The next Genera' Election will doubtless P id the machinery nf the lo?.al Ilt.inch in a stet 3of high efficiency and their strength will certainly be of peramonnt importance --; fact a balancing power. All Irishmen are relied to suppoit the loclt branch both with their personal assistance and finsncially.</p>
