      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-07-17_WidnesExaminer_art0053" n="art0053">
        <head>AFTER A E• r 0</head>
        <p>AFTER A E• r 0</p>
        <p>When digestion fails, whether from loss of tone, climatic changes, over- work, or errors of diet, nothing so soon restores tone and vitality to the diges- tive system as the. root and herb _ _</p>
